{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026k9e1VJzPsV1795740842.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>被視為日本通脹指標的東京消費物價指數(CPI)，仍遠高於央行目標。</p><p></p><p>日本總務省公布，11月東京消費物價指數按年升幅維持在百分之2.8。撇除新鮮食品的核心東京消費物價指數，按年升幅擴大至百分之2.9，是去年7月以來最高。當中食品價格上升百分之2.9；公用事業急升百分之8.5，較9月擴大6.3個百分點；交運運輸及通訊，升幅擴大至百分之3.7。</p><p></p><p>分析認為，東京通脹進一步上升，令日本央行保持警惕，數據印證近期物價持續受壓，並強化日本央行下月加息的理由。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.785246+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:37:37.021167+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:37:15.536903+00:00","content_hash":"649156c5fcfe3253a00ad1480df815421f93de391a1346d1c33eceee4a05bf3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.785246+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}